  "observations": [
    "The 64 byte-decoded pixel matches reuse the accepted build 2279 visual inspection with unchanged layouts.",
    "All 12 changed Market, custom rankings and Commissioner pairs were visually inspected at 320, 375, 390 and 1280 px.",
    "Market puts mode, search and position controls above the rows. On narrow screens long names wrap, the league selector stays separate from DTOS, and the rows retain explicit missing-value and missing-movement text.",
    "Current matched 320, 390 and 1280 captures show viewable full details, named roster relevance, dated movement, supported zero, exact Trade For and the limitations disclosure with keyboard focus.",
    "Custom rankings retains the existing editor and updates only the active Market navigation state. Commissioner changes in the paired pixels are the fixture last-visit dates.",
    "Rendered Chromium fixtures only. Authenticated signed-in production and physical iPhone Safari remain unverified."
  ]
}
